<title>USA: BTU International Inc Q4 net decreases.</title>
<headline>BTU International Inc Q4 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			  Dec. 31,   Dec. 31,   Dec. 31,   Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
