<p>and Equivalents</p>
<p>			 7,321,620  7,378,327  7,335,089  7,300,644</p>
<p>		 (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal year 1996 included an after tax gain of $2.8 million, or $0.38 per share, from the sale of the company's minor stake in Bruce Technologies International Inc.</p>
